mm6108-firmware (2.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream firmware release 2.1.
  * debian/rules: upstream never pushed the mm6108-2.1 tag, so pin to the
    "Firmware binaries for Release 2.1" commit
    (ce39cefb5fd01ad689a0c0b043557d9c2a3167d8), as was done for 1.17.x.
  * debian/watch: track the per-chip 'mm6108-' tags; upstream tags the
    MM6108 and MM8108 series separately (both at the same release commit),
    so the stale note about upstream having no tags is dropped.
  * debian/watch: match the archive extension in filenamemangle so the
    downloaded tarball is not named mm6108-firmware-<version>.tar.gz.tar.gz.

